{"4604320":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"失焦 Out of Focus","steam_appid":4604320,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old case, a truth out of focus. As a police officer, you must work with your colleagues to uncover the story behind this seemingly ordinary murder.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic mystery setup rooted in real-world logic.What you're about to solve is far more than just this case.This is a side-scrolling pixel art narrative RPG with elements of psychological horror and puzzle-solving.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters and events in this story are fictional. Any resemblance to real persons or events is purely coincidental.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to move<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space\/z\/Enter to confirm\/investigate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc to cancel\/open the menu<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + arrow keys to run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4604320\/extras\/ce6102384721ede1658c09823ad857b3.avif?t=1780027897\" width=287 height=287 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madoka Asano, a police academy student. Influenced by her criminal police father, she has loved mystery works since childhood. Due to her outstanding academic performance, she was recommended to assist in a joint police investigation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has sharp observation skills and incredible intuition. She likes to show off, but beneath her mature-looking appearance lies childish recklessness, and she lacks practical experience in facing difficult cases head-on.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4604320\/extras\/47d2c09218ba6003d42891df704f3a6f.avif?t=1780027897\" width=287 height=287 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eiji Asano, a veteran criminal police officer with over twenty years of service. During his career, he has cracked numerous major criminal cases, with an almost obsessive dedication to the truth and absolute calm. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He never shows his emotions or makes unnecessary remarks, only presenting decisive evidence at critical moments to set the direction of the entire investigation in the most concise way possible.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4604320\/extras\/04e0e95f59ec427e3b93cdb4f11a02bd.avif?t=1780027897\" width=287 height=287 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rikako Asahi, the most promising young star in the forensic field, known for her absolute rationality and precise autopsy analysis. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She trusts the evidence left by the dead more than dealing with the living, always able to read the unspoken truth from the silent details.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4604320\/extras\/69b5bf91a530b6e27f44a950591d400f.avif?t=1780027897\" width=287 height=287 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kurokawa, Officer Asano's most capable assistant and the indispensable intelligence core of the team. With an almost instinctive sensitivity to information, whether it's subtle testimonies during interrogations or clues hidden in reports, he can always organize them into clear and coherent key leads.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old case, a truth out of focus. As a police officer, you must work with your colleagues to uncover the story behind this seemingly ordinary murder.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic mystery setup rooted in real-world logic.What you're about to solve is far more than just this case.This is a side-scrolling pixel art narrative RPG with elements of psychological horror and puzzle-solving.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters and events in this story are fictional. Any resemblance to real persons or events is purely coincidental.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to move<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space\/z\/Enter to confirm\/investigate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc to cancel\/open the menu<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift + arrow keys to run<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4604320\/extras\/ce6102384721ede1658c09823ad857b3.avif?t=1780027897\" width=287 height=287 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madoka Asano, a police academy student. Influenced by her criminal police father, she has loved mystery works since childhood. Due to her outstanding academic performance, she was recommended to assist in a joint police investigation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has sharp observation skills and incredible intuition. She likes to show off, but beneath her mature-looking appearance lies childish recklessness, and she lacks practical experience in facing difficult cases head-on.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/ste